# fifo_child_version_lowered: The stamp index check runs at signal time against the current maxFIFOCount, with `>`. Children with stampIndex 40 and 32 are defined at version 245 (maxFIFOCount 64); after 0x1034 = 60 (maxFIFOCount 32), stampIndex 40's stamps are dropped ("Invalid stamp index"), with no interrupt, while stampIndex 32 still publishes, as 32 > 32 is false. Barriers on index 40 now fault. Back at 245, 40 publishes again: the dropped stamp was consumed, so the slot jumps.
